you do have the ability to switch to  your offhand weapon while on horseback  this one drove me crazy for a while guys  it seems like such a simple one that i  knew there had to be a way to do this in  the game maybe it even tells you in the  game and i just completely missed it by  default your right hand weapon will be  equipped when you're riding horseback  pressing l1 however doesn't use your  left hand weapon instead it uses your  right hand weapon but swings on the left  side now i'm playing as a mage right now  and i usually like running with my staff  and my left hand and my sword in my  right hand of course you can see the  problem here whenever i hop on my horse  i couldn't figure out a way to switch to  the staff in my left hand but this one's  actually super simple all you have to do  is press the button combination for two  handing your weapon while you're on  horseback so for ps4 ps5 this is going  to be triangle and r1 at the same time  again if you're on horseback rather than  two-handing your right-hand weapon it  will instead switch to your left-hand  weapon now if you're a mage like me and  running the staff in your left hand you  will have to use r1 to cast the spells  when you're on horseback
 

